---
description: >-
  BT gitGraph cherry-pick variant where the cherry-pick's tag is explicitly set to an empty
  string, checking that an empty tag is handled without rendering a stray tag label.
---
gitGraph BT:
  commit id: "ZERO"
  branch develop
  commit id:"A"
  checkout main
  commit id:"ONE"
  checkout develop
  commit id:"B"
  checkout main
  commit id:"TWO"
  cherry-pick id:"A" tag: ""
  commit id:"THREE"
  checkout develop
  commit id:"C"
